The Firm was founded by Ralph J Visco in 1955 and carried on by son-in-law, Larry Muse as LJM&nbsp;
Engineering Group in 1993. In 2016, Greg and Helle-May Cheney picked up the baton to&nbsp;
continue the firm legacy of a family-owned business serving the New Jersey AEC community.
